<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $150 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $150 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Wako International and International Bank of Japan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  COUPON     6.10 PCT  MATURITY    28.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.OCT.96</p>
<p>FULL FEES  35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
